  title: 'Purane Saal Ka Section 7E Notice Aa Gaya — Abolition Ke Baad Kya Karein',
  description: 'Section 7E ab abolished hai lekin purane tax years ka notice aa jaye to jawab kaise dena hai aur kaunse documents kaam aate hain.',
  ogTitle: 'Section 7E Notice — Abolition Ke Baad Purane Saal Ka Jawab Kaise Dein',
  ogDescription: 'Section 7E ki FCC ruling se abolition ke baad, purane tax years (TY2026 aur pehle) ka notice mile to practical response guide.',
  headline: 'Purane Saal Ka Section 7E Notice Aa Gaya — Abolition Ke Baad Kya Karein',
  breadcrumbName: 'Section 7E Purana Notice',
  h1: 'Purane Saal Ka Section 7E Notice Aa Gaya — Abolition Ke Baad Kya Karein',
  datePublished: '2026-09-11',
