    { q: 'Kya backlog file karne ke liye deadline se pehle hi shuru karna zaroori hai?', a: 'Nahi, backlog catch-up saal ke kisi bhi waqt shuru ho sakta hai, yeh 30 September ki annual deadline se juda nahi. Jitni jaldi shuru karein utna behtar, chahe woh saal ka koi bhi mahina ho.' }
